{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "NexGen Standard Injury Catalog",
    "version": 1,
    "source": "data/injury_catalog.json",
    "description": "Baseline injury catalog seeded into every new league. The 'collision', 'hit_by_pitch' and 'pitcher_overuse' trigger blocks are kept identical to the engine's built-in fallback (calibration-neutral for the injuries that already fire). The 'throwing', 'swing' and 'fielding' triggers + their injuries are DEFINED here (Phase 1 of injury calibration) but the engines do not yet roll them - engine call sites (Phase 2) and probability/severity calibration to real-MLB rates per commissioner injury level (Phase 3) are pending. Their base_probability/severity values below are calibration starting points, not final. attributes_penalty keys are limited to pow/con/spd/vel/ctrl/sta; dl_tier is none/dl15/ir."
  },
